    96→
    97→/**
    98→ * Gossip handlers perform validation + handling in a single function.
    99→ * - This gossip handlers MUST only be registered as validator functions. No handler is registered for any topic.
   100→ * - All `chain/validation/*` functions MUST throw typed GossipActionError instances so they gossip action is captured
   101→ *   by `getGossipValidatorFn()` try catch block.
   102→ * - This gossip handlers should not let any handling errors propagate to the caller. Only validation errors must be thrown.
